  "notes": [
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-activityawardexport-0000001158245071#section20546835",
      "text": "获取指定给用户群发奖的报表数据的CSV文件地址。接口调用者的角色：账号持有者、管理员、App管理员、运营、财务。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用约束",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-activityawardexport-0000001158245071#section1938712427321",
      "text": "本接口仅支持在中国大陆地区发布的应用。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用约束",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-activityawardexport-0000001158245071#section1938712427321",
      "text": "为了防止注入风险，给指定用户群发奖的报表内容中的“活动名称”如果存在特殊字符（“+”或“-”或“@”或“=”），则会对该“活动名称”做转义处理。转义处理的规则是在待转义字符串前加tab键，然后将整个字符串用双引号括起来。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-activityawardexport-0000001158245071#section236517415165",
      "text": "本接口支持使用Service Account方式、API客户端方式和OAuth客户端方式，区别请参见使用入门。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-activityawardexport-0000001158245071#section236517415165",
      "text": "Service Account方式："
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/agcapi-activityawardexport-0000001158245071#section236517415165",
